@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_TEST_TOKEN

# Target examples; routes are learner work and UUIDs must be replaced.

### Nested query: <=4 SQL queries for this workload
POST {{base}}/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"operationName":"CatalogPage","query":"query CatalogPage($first:Int!){courses(first:$first){edges{node{id title lessons{id title} enrollmentCount}} pageInfo{endCursor hasNextPage}}}","variables":{"first":20}}

### Instructor creates a draft
POST {{base}}/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"query":"mutation { createCourse(input:{title:\"Spring Foundations\",clientMutationId:\"example-1\"}) { course { id status } clientMutationId } }"}
